# HTTP response headers for Cloudflare Pages. Copied into dist/ by the build.
# Format: a path pattern, then indented "Name: value" lines. Comments are kept up
# here, at the start of a line, on purpose: an indented "#" inside a rule can be
# read as a malformed header.
#
# These headers only take effect on Cloudflare. `npm run dev` and `npm run preview`
# do not apply this file.
#
# THE CONTENT-SECURITY-POLICY LINE IS A PLACEHOLDER. scripts/build-headers.mjs runs
# after `astro build`, hashes every inline script in the built HTML, and swaps the
# finished policy in. Do not paste a policy over it by hand: the hashes change
# whenever an inline script does, and a stale hash silently blocks that script.
#
# What each header is for:
#   Strict-Transport-Security  Use HTTPS for this domain for a year, so a first
#                              request over plain HTTP on a hostile network cannot
#                              be intercepted and downgraded. Deliberately NOT
#                              includeSubDomains and NOT preload: both are very
#                              hard to undo and neither is needed here.
#   X-Frame-Options            Stops other sites framing this one to trick visitors
#                              into clicking things. frame-ancestors in the CSP does
#                              the same for modern browsers; this covers older ones.
#   Permissions-Policy         Switches off browser features the site never uses, so
#                              nothing injected could ask for them either.
#   Content-Security-Policy    Lists exactly where scripts, styles, fonts and
#                              connections may come from. Anything else is refused.
#   Cache-Control on /_astro/  Those files carry a content hash in their name, so a
#                              changed file always gets a new URL and an old one can
#                              be cached for good. Without this Cloudflare re-checks
#                              them every 4 hours.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: __CSP__

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
